- **Bracken closes the file:** four boxes, 311 documents, "a thing that goes on being true in a room where nobody who built it is standing." The institution holds still for three days, "the hardest athletic feat he had seen all season."
- **Arrival, the twelfth of Reaping. Havel window (≈2,400):** up the bluff road in the second carriage; the courtyard corners before its center; deciding where the subject would stand and not looking up there; his career's two rises; nothing above his clearance. Then Cael on the upper tier: Ilsev carries her own case. **The third carriage.** The count comes back wrong three ways: the aides orbit; the man generates no orbit; the insignia announces an altitude the bearing never performs. Attention sampled *evenly* on purpose. "That one crossed a courtyard." **"New opponent. No tells. Begin."**

