editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/STATE_LEDGER.md-177-- **Calendar of the term (deviation, flagged):** Bracken is one of Karis's nine week-4 correspondents; his letters begin in wk 8 (four questions), the fourth in wk 11 (forty-one), the fifteenth in wk 17 (no questions). The source places the letters in wks 14–19. Twenty-two in all; he writes by every coach without waiting for answers.
--
